<title>HONG KONG: Trading in China Resources shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in China Resources shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Resources Enterprise Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
